From 63a08ee57a8c41d8872e80c2232eeb2647e9789a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dhanraj <dp914278@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 13:38:21 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] tests: Cover native dual-pane navigation and lifetime
 boundaries

Exercise Home-first split creation, independent tabs, grouped canvas Tab
and Shift+Tab, editor/popover exclusions, ordinary/background reuse focus,
post-frame promotion, nullable close snapshots, history/transfer, and
retained-child/repeated disposal. Verify proportional geometry and minimum
negotiation using real slots and windows with one application fixture.

Keep the complete suite as the companion to the production feature, with
no later test-fix patches or test-only production APIs.

Cover hover activation, preserved editing/popover context, held-button
suppression and stationary-pointer keyboard navigation in real windows.
---
